title: "Donghyun-lang (동현랭): a Korean esoteric programming language with a browser playground"
type: software
version: "1.53"
date-released: "2026-10-26"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.23689480"
authors:
  - family-names: Kim
    given-names: Dong Hyun
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-9883-0229"
    affiliation: "Inha University College of Medicine"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Raspberry-Kim/donghyun-lang"
url: "https://raspberry-kim.github.io/donghyun-lang/"
abstract: >-
  Donghyun-lang is an esoteric programming language written in Korean.
  The repository contains the JavaScript interpreter, a browser playground
  that runs without installation or a server, a Python interpreter, the
  language specification and 70 example programs. Donghyun-lang is also the
  only control language of three educational browser laboratories by the
  same author: Donghyuncho (Drosophila brain circuits), Donghyunpa
  (C. elegans touch circuits) and Donghyunbil (village outbreaks on a real
  contact network).
keywords:
  - esoteric programming language
  - Korean
  - interpreter
  - programming education
  - JavaScript
  - Python
